8. **Opening animation** (skippable, once per session, respects reduced motion): pieces slide onto a board and form the club name.
9. **Custom 404:** "Illegal move" with a back-to-home button.
10. **Gallery:** squares flip to reveal photos; lightbox with keyboard arrows.
11. **Optional subtle sound toggle** (piece move sound on the board only), off by default.
12. **Micro-interactions:** buttons with a short "piece slide", focused fields glow like a selected square, cards tilt slightly on hover (desktop only).

### Rules
- Mobile-first (visitors come from Instagram, WhatsApp, QR codes). Test layouts at 360 px.
- Accessible: semantic HTML, labels, visible focus, focus-trap and Escape in all dialogs, contrast AA, `prefers-reduced-motion` disables all non-essential animation, board playable by keyboard with move announcements via `aria-live`.
- Arabic: `dir="rtl"` on the document, mirrored layout via logical CSS properties (`margin-inline-start`, etc.). The chess board itself and algebraic notation stay LTR.
